timeline: 1
# The Marvel universe on one time axis, in three bands of rows, top to bottom:
#   rows 0 to 425: what happens in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, at the in-universe date the films and series give it.
#   rows 428 to 605: when Marvel films, series and cartoons reached the screen, and the studio milestones.
#   rows 608 to 918: when Marvel comics were published (cover dates), with their debuts, events and company milestones.
# An event its sources date only to a year or a month is spread across that year or month in story order: its day places it, it is not a date.
# Relations labelled "adapted" lead from a comic to the screen work that adapted it, and "shows" from a film to an event it shows.
